<title>USA: Pomeroy Computer sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Pomeroy Computer sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HEBRON, Ky.</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pomeroy Computer Resources said on Friday it approved a three-for-two stock split in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The split is available to all holders of record as of Sept. 19. Certificates for the additional shares will be issued by Oct. 4, the company said.</p>
<p>Shares finished exchange trading up one at 21-3/4.</p>
</text>
